## Project overview

This repo documents an ESP32-based module paired with a small I/O board that includes:

* ESP32-WROOM module on a breakout style carrier (USB-C power and serial).
* Ultrasonic sensor interface (HC-SR04 style), PIR motion sensor, OLED, LEDs, buzzer and simple UI.
* On-board 3.3V regulator (AMS1117-3.3) and related decoupling.
* Designed and routed in EasyEDA (schematic, PCB and 3D previews included).

The goal: a compact sensor board for distance detection + motion detection with local user feedback (OLED + buzzer + LEDs), ready to be flashed with ESP32 firmware.

