## Schematic & PCB



The schematic uses an ESP32-WROOM module symbol connected to: USB-C power, AMS1117-3.3 regulator, I2C OLED, ultrasonic header, PIR sensor header, LEDs and buzzer. The design is split across two mechanical boards in the layout: the ESP32 carrier and the sensor/UI board.

* Keep decoupling capacitors close to the regulator and ESP32 power pins.
* Ensure the USB-C VBUS (5V) net and the regulator VIN are connected only where intended (avoid shorting 5V to 3.3V nets).

