## Power and regulator

* Input: USB-C 5V (VBUS) -> AMS1117-3.3 -> 3.3V rail.
* AMS1117 requires input/output decoupling: recommended 10uF on input and 10uF on output plus local 0.1uF ceramics close to the ESP32.
* PIR sensor may require 5V input depending on model (HC-SR501 runs at 5V but outputs 3.3V compatible logic). Verify in your design.

